$DATUM 3,3-Diethyl-1-[3,4,5-tris(4-bromophenyl)phenyl]triaz-1-ene (9). A
suspension of 8 (500 mg, 0.9 mmol), 4-bromophenylboronic acid (1.08 g,
5.41 mmol), K2CO3 (3.73 g, 27.04 mmol), and Aliquat 336 (11 mg, 0.03
mmol) in toluene (50 mL) was deoxygenated three times via a
“freeze-pump-thaw” cycle. [Pd(PPh3)4] (121 mg, 0.1 mmol) was added, and
the solution was stirred for 18 h at 80 °C. The mixture was diluted with
H2O (30 mL) and extracted with CH2Cl2 (3 × 30 mL). The combined organic
layers were dried over MgSO4, filtered, and concentrated in vacuo. FC
(Al2O3; hexane/ CH2Cl2 4:1) gave 9 (411 mg, 71%) as a yellow greasy
solid. Rf = 0.21 (SiO2; hexane/CH2Cl2 4:1); mp 167-168 °C; 1H NMR (400
MHz, CDCl3, 25 °C): δ = 1.27 (br. t, J = 7.2 Hz, 6 H), 3.79 (br. q, J =
7.2 Hz, 4 H), 6.67 (br. d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2 H), 6.95 (br. d, J = 8.5 Hz, 4
H), 7.15 (br. d, J = 8.4 Hz, 2 H), 7.30 (br. d, J = 8.5 Hz, 4 H), 7.44
ppm (s, 2 H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3, 25 °C): δ = 27.1, 120.5, 120.8,
121.9, 130.9, 131.0, 131.6, 133.4, 134.2, 138.2, 140.8, 141,5, 150.6 ppm
(13 out of 14 signals expected); IR (ATR): ν = 2972 (w), 2902 (w), 1590
(m), 1486 (m), 1436 (m), 1395 (m), 1332 (s), 1244 (m), 1071 (m), 1009
(s), 741 (s), 663 (m), 636 cm-1 (m); HR-MALDI-MS (DCTB): m/z (%):
639.9596 (33, [M + H+], calc. for C28H25Br3N3 +: 639.9593), 640.9434
(18), 641.9576 (100), 642.9610 (29), 643.9556 (96), 644.9588 (30),
645.9536 (32). Crystal Data for 9: Crystal data at 100 K for C28H24Br3N3,
M = 642.23 g mol-1, triclinic, space group , a = 7.1349(4) Å, b =
11.2698(5) Å, c = 16.4853(8) Å, α = 79.288(2)°, β = 87.269(3)°, γ =
79.285(2)°, V = 1279.64(11) Å3, Z = 2, D c = 1.667 g/cm3, μ(Mo-Kα) =
4.751 mm-1. Clear colorless plate crystals (linear dimensions ca. 0.18 ×
0.12 × 0.10 mm) were grown from CHCl3/hexane solution at 25 °C. Number of
measured and unique reflections 12621 and 7205, respectively (R int =
0.0193). Final R 1 = 0.0502, wR 2 = 0.1164 for 5489 independent
reflections with I> 2σ(I), 351 parameters and 4.112 < 2θ < 61.146°
(corresponding R values based on all 7205 reflections are 0.0709 and
0.1270, respectively). The NEt2 unit is disordered about 2 positions with
75:25 ratio.
